cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Anupravaha-I in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Anupravaha-I: A structured multi-block finite-volume Navier–Stokes solver"
abstract: >-
  Anupravaha-I is an educational, structured multi-block, finite-volume
  Navier–Stokes solver for incompressible and weakly-compressible flow,
  conjugate heat transfer, turbulence, natural and mixed convection, and
  liquid-metal MHD. Developed at the Indian Institute of Technology
  Kanpur and used in graduate-level CFD instruction.
type: software
